          "changeMeaning": "Mars slows and reverses, beginning a westward retrograde loop, with the label updating to mark the reversal.",
          "narration": "But then something strange happens. Mars slows, stops, and reverses direction, looping back toward the west. For about two months it moves backward against the stars."
        },
