          "changeMeaning": "Establishes the geocentric model with Earth at the center and a deferent circle, framing the historical worldview.",
          "narration": "For nearly two thousand years, most astronomers placed Earth at the center of the cosmos, with the planets carried around it on circles. This is the geocentric model."
        },
        {
          "clipName": "clip1",
          "audioClip": "retro_scene2_epicycle",
          "autoAdvance": false,
          "changes": [
