                  "text": "Accurate, but awkward...",
                  "color": [
                    255,
                    180,
                    120,
                    255
                  ],
                  "fontSize": 40,
                  "wrapText": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "changeMeaning": "Highlights the awkwardness of the construction, motivating the need for a simpler explanation in the next scene.",
          "narration": "This clever construction reproduced the loops, but it was awkward. Each planet needed its own carefully tuned epicycle, and as observations improved, even more circles were piled on. There had to be a simpler explanation."
        }
